{"timestamp": 1779353334.994944, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 14, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I reported in weapons \u2014 Eve\u2019s body was right there when I arrived. I didn\u2019t see the kill happen.\n\nMy route was medbay \u2192 electrical \u2192 security \u2192 weapons. I saw Bob go from cafeteria into medbay early, then Bob came into electrical from medbay around tick 5 and I saw him in electrical at ticks 6-8. Frank was also in electrical at tick 8, then I saw Frank later in security around ticks 12-13 after he entered from electrical.\n\nI didn\u2019t see Alice or Charlie at all this round. Bob being dead in medbay is weird because I last saw him alive in electrical, so he must have gone back toward medbay after that. I don\u2019t have a hard accusation yet, but Frank was the only person I saw near Bob\u2019s last known area."}}
{"timestamp": 1779353357.621096, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 14, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I started navigation, went through security, then weapons, cafeteria, medbay, and ended upper engine. I saw Alice and Eve in security around tick 4, then Eve was alive in weapons around tick 5 when I passed through. I didn\u2019t see a body there then.\n\nLater I went through medbay and saw Bob alive there around ticks 9-10 \u2014 he had just come in from electrical, I think. I left toward upper engine after that and didn\u2019t see anyone else.\n\nSo from my side, Eve died after tick 5 in weapons, and Bob died after tick 10 in or near medbay. Diana\u2019s info makes Frank look a bit questionable to me, since he was around electrical/security, which connects to both Bob\u2019s last area and Eve\u2019s body location. Not hard accusing, but that\u2019s the main overlap I\u2019m seeing."}}
{"timestamp": 1779353376.7577522, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 14, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "My route was storage \u2192 medbay \u2192 electrical \u2192 security. I saw Bob and Diana together in electrical around ticks 7-8. At tick 9 I saw Bob leave electrical toward medbay. I did not follow him back into medbay \u2014 I stayed moving toward security.\n\nI saw Diana again in security around tick 12, and then at tick 13 she left security toward weapons, which lines up with her reporting Eve there.\n\nCharlie saying he saw Bob alive in medbay around ticks 9-10 matches what I saw: Bob left electrical toward medbay. So Bob died after that. I never went to weapons at all, so I couldn\u2019t have killed Eve there.\n\nRight now the big unknown is Alice, since nobody has seen her much. Diana did go directly into weapons before the report, but that could just be finding the body. I\u2019d like to hear Alice\u2019s route before deciding."}}
{"timestamp": 1779353425.920149, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 14, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I was on the right side: electrical \u2192 security \u2192 navigation. I saw Eve in security around ticks 3-4, and Charlie entered security from navigation at tick 4. I didn\u2019t see Bob, Diana, or Frank at all.\n\nCharlie\u2019s early route matches what I saw, but the problem is he\u2019s the only one who places himself at both death areas: he says he saw Eve alive in weapons around tick 5, then later Bob alive in medbay around ticks 9-10. Those are both last-seen-alive moments from his own story. Diana and Frank seem to confirm each other around electrical/security later, and Frank says he never went weapons.\n\nI don\u2019t think this is 100%, but with two bodies, Charlie has the clearest opportunity for both kills. I\u2019m leaning Charlie here."}}
{"timestamp": 1779353449.703112, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 14, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I want to correct/emphasize: my report was specifically Eve\u2019s body in weapons, not Bob. I found Eve when I entered from security after seeing Frank there.\n\nAfter hearing everyone, Charlie\u2019s story is the one that worries me most. Alice confirms Charlie was in security with Eve early, then Charlie says he went through weapons and saw Eve alive, and later he also places himself in medbay seeing Bob alive. That puts him at both last-seen locations before both deaths.\n\nFrank\u2019s path lines up with what I saw: electrical with Bob, then security later. I still think Frank had proximity to Bob\u2019s path, but he doesn\u2019t have a weapons route from what we\u2019ve heard. Alice is less seen, but her info matches Charlie/Eve in security.\n\nI\u2019m leaning Charlie right now because he has the clearest opportunity for both kills."}}
{"timestamp": 1779353482.858211, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 14, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I get why it looks bad on paper, but \u201cCharlie saw both people alive\u201d is not the same as \u201cCharlie killed both.\u201d I\u2019m the one volunteering those last-seen times \u2014 if I were trying to hide this, I wouldn\u2019t put myself there.\n\nThe biggest thing bothering me is Alice\u2019s route. Alice saw me and Eve in security at tick 4, but after that nobody confirms Alice anywhere. Eve was alive in weapons right after, and Alice was literally on that side with a direct path to weapons. Then Alice says she went navigation, but there\u2019s no witness after tick 4. That\u2019s a lot of unaccounted time for both the weapons kill and potentially looping toward medbay.\n\nFrank and Diana at least have overlapping sightings around electrical/security later. Alice is the one using my own info to frame me while having the least verified route. I\u2019m leaning Alice much more than Frank now."}}
{"timestamp": 1779353503.25487, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 14, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I\u2019m still leaning Charlie over Alice here. Alice is less confirmed after tick 4, that\u2019s true, but Charlie\u2019s route puts him directly through weapons when Eve was last alive and then medbay when Bob was last alive. That\u2019s not just \u201csaw both alive\u201d \u2014 it\u2019s being the common point near both bodies.\n\nMy own route is still storage \u2192 medbay \u2192 electrical \u2192 security. I saw Bob and Diana in electrical ticks 7-8, Bob left to medbay at tick 9, and I did not follow him. Diana and I overlap again in security at tick 12, then she goes weapons at tick 13 and reports Eve. So I can\u2019t place Diana at Bob\u2019s death, and I can\u2019t place myself at weapons.\n\nAlice could have done Eve if she went weapons after security, but for Bob too she\u2019d need a lot of unconfirmed movement. Charlie\u2019s path naturally covers both. Unless the last speaker has something strong, I think Charlie is the best vote."}}
{"timestamp": 1779353528.5050979, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 14, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I\u2019ll answer Charlie\u2019s point: yes, I\u2019m less confirmed after tick 4, but my route was away from weapons \u2014 electrical to security to navigation. I saw Eve and Charlie in security, and Charlie came in from navigation at tick 4. After that, Charlie\u2019s own claimed path takes him straight through weapons where Eve later dies, then through medbay where Bob later dies.\n\nFor me to be the duck, I\u2019d have to leave toward navigation, double back to weapons for Eve, then somehow also get over to medbay for Bob without anyone seeing me, while Diana and Frank are overlapping around electrical/security. That\u2019s possible in theory, but it\u2019s a much messier route than Charlie\u2019s.\n\nCharlie is the only one whose story naturally connects both bodies: security/weapon side for Eve, then medbay for Bob. Diana and Frank are cross-confirming each other enough that I don\u2019t think they\u2019re the best vote here. I\u2019m voting Charlie."}}
